WEBVTT

00:13:29.054 --> 00:13:30.430
ND: What's your favorite?

00:13:30.472 --> 00:13:34.476
HH: Oh, I don't know.
I've got a couple of favorites.

00:13:34.476 --> 00:13:35.477
ND: Yeah?

00:13:35.477 --> 00:13:38.647
HH: I think a lot of astronomers’ ...
favorite system right now

00:13:38.647 --> 00:13:40.065
is the TRAPPIST-1 system.

00:13:40.065 --> 00:13:41.441
ND: Yeah. Tell me about it.

00:13:41.441 --> 00:13:44.278
HH: TRAPPIST-1 is --
that's the name of the star.

00:13:44.278 --> 00:13:46.572
TRAPPIST is the name of the survey, right?

00:13:46.572 --> 00:13:51.326
But it looked at this star
and it discovered

00:13:51.368 --> 00:13:56.331
that there are at least
seven planets orbiting this star.

00:13:56.373 --> 00:14:01.795
And most of those planets
seem to be Earth-sized.